// Module c-neurocritical: raised intracranial pressure and neurocritical care. The Monro-Kellie
// doctrine, compliance, cerebral perfusion pressure, and the Cushing response; herniation syndromes
// and first-line measures at a principles level; and brain death (death by neurologic criteria)
// following the 2023 AAN/AAP/CNS/SCCM consensus guideline. The coma examination itself is taught in
// x-coma and is not repeated here.

